  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "In the branch containing \\(L\\) and \\(R_{2}\\)\r\n\r\n\\(\\begin{aligned} &\\mathrm{i}=\\frac{\\mathrm{E}}{\\mathrm{R}_{2}}\\left(1-\\mathrm{e}^{-\\frac{\\mathrm{R}_{2} \\mathrm{t}}{\\mathrm{L}}}\\right) \\\\ &\\frac{\\mathrm{di}}{\\mathrm{dt}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{E}}{\\mathrm{R}_{2}} \\mathrm{e}^{-\\frac{\\mathrm{R}_{2} \\mathrm{t}}{\\mathrm{L}}} \\cdot \\frac{\\mathrm{R}_{2}}{\\mathrm{~L}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{E}}{\\mathrm{L}} \\mathrm{e}^{-\\frac{\\mathrm{R}_{2} \\mathrm{t}}{\\mathrm{L}}} \\\\ &\\therefore \\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{L}}=\\mathrm{L} \\frac{\\mathrm{di}}{\\mathrm{dt}}=\\mathrm{Ee}^{-\\frac{\\mathrm{R}_{2} \\mathrm{t}}{\\mathrm{L}}} \\\\ &=12 \\mathrm{e}^{-\\frac{2 \\mathrm{t}}{400 \\times 10^{-3}}}=12 \\mathrm{e}^{-5 \\mathrm{t}} \\mathrm{V} \\end{aligned}\\)",
